# Dashboard side of the live PDRN refresh (scripts/pdrn_from_sap.py). Usually NOTHING to set here:
# the SAP login lives in the API folder (C:\VendorGlobe_API\pdrn.env); the API loads SAP into SQL
# PDRN.dbo.SAP_PDRN at 13:00 / 17:00 and this script reads that table through the API.
# Copy to pdrn.env only if you need to change something. pdrn.env is git-ignored.

# where the SQL snapshot is read from (VendorGlobe API on this server)
# VG_PDRN_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5002/pdrn/rows
# VG_PDRN_API_TOKEN=        (only if the API runs on another machine)
# VG_PDRN_MIN_RATIO=0.9

# Emergency only - skip SQL and call SAP directly from here:
# VG_PDRN_SOURCE=sap
# VG_PDRN_USER=
# VG_PDRN_PASSWORD=
